 inbox:'<polyline points="22 12 16 12 14 15 10 15 8 12 2 12"/><path d="M5.5 5.1 2 12v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-6l-3.5-6.9A2 2 0 0 0 16.8 4H7.2a2 2 0 0 0-1.7 1.1z"/>',
